              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba kulotshiwe ukuthi u-Abrahama wayenamadodana amabili, enye kweyesigqilakazi, enye kowesifazane okhululekileyo.",
          "type": "text",
