        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba kulotshiwe ukuthi: “Jabula wena nyumba ongazalanga; gqamuka ukhale, wena ongabhibhiyo, ngokuba abantwana boyisigebenga baningi kunalowo onomyeni.",
